1- the actors that may request changes to parking garage are : the payment team, pricing team, logging team.
the payment team: If payment processing or refund rules change, the checkout() or cancel() methods will need to change
the pricing team: if parking fees change, the fee() method will need to change
the logging team: the logging mechanism might change, for example if they want to store the receipts in a database instead of a file

